<!-- KWIZZ Radio About Station Page -->
<div class="space-y-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="border-b pb-8 text-center space-y-3" style="border-color: var(--border-color);">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full badge-gold text-xs font-semibold">
      <span>100% INTERNET RADIO &bull; FOUNDED IN OTTAWA, CANADA</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black" style="color: var(--text-primary);">
      About KWIZZ Radio
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
      Preserving and celebrating Caribbean sound system culture, authentic reggae roots, and high-energy dancehall in Canada's national capital region and across the globe.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Story Sections -->
  <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
    <div class="kwizz-card p-8 space-y-4 shadow-xl" style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--border-color);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Our Mission &amp; Roots</h2>
      <p>
        KWIZZ Radio was established in Ottawa to provide a dedicated, authentic musical home for lovers of Caribbean music. While mainstream commercial radio often overlooks the depth of reggae culture, KWIZZ Radio brings the full spectrum: from foundational 1970s rocksteady and conscious roots to heavy UK dubs, lovers rock, and the latest dancehall riddims out of Kingston, London, and Toronto.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you are listening from Ottawa, Montreal, Toronto, or international corners across the Caribbean diaspora, KWIZZ Radio delivers a continuous 24/7 high-definition audio stream accompanied by live DJ shows, guest mixes, and community spotlights.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Internet-Only Station Highlight Box -->
    <div class="kwizz-card p-8 space-y-4 border-2 shadow-xl" style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--reggae-gold);">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl badge-gold flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">100% Worldwide Internet Radio</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-500">Pure Digital HD Audio &bull; No FM/AM Dial Required</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        KWIZZ Radio is a modern, pure internet radio station. Unlike legacy terrestrial broadcasters bound to regional FM or AM frequencies, KWIZZ Radio streams directly over IP networks to your smartphone, computer, car system, and smart speakers worldwide. No frequency tuning, no atmospheric static, no reception drop-offs — just instant, crystal-clear reggae wherever you have an internet connection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="kwizz-card p-8 space-y-3" style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--border-color);">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-black flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg mb-2 shadow-md shadow-amber-400/20">
          HQ
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Digital Audio Quality &amp; Tech</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          Broadcasting in pristine 128 kbps stereo MP3. Built on a cutting-edge persistent web architecture that ensures your listening experience is completely uninterrupted as you browse through schedules, event listings, and DJ profiles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="kwizz-card p-8 space-y-3" style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--border-color);">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 text-black flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg mb-2 shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/20">
          &copy;
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Music Licensing &amp; Rights</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          KWIZZ Radio strictly adheres to Canadian and international performance rights. Streaming is powered through our licensed platform partner Live365, ensuring full royalty compliance with SOCAN, Re:Sound, SoundExchange, BMI, ASCAP, and SESAC.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Community Involvement -->
    <div class="kwizz-card p-8 space-y-4" style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--border-color);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Community &amp; Events</h2>
      <p>
        We actively partner with Ottawa cultural organizations, Caribbean food festivals, and local music promoters. From sound clashes to live outdoor broadcasts at Lebreton Flats and the Bronson Centre, KWIZZ Radio is a catalyst for unity, positive vibrations, and community empowerment.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
